<title>SPAIN: CNMV ends Vidriera Leonesa suspension.</title>
<headline>CNMV ends Vidriera Leonesa suspension.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's stock market commission CNMV said on Wednesday it was cancelling the trading suspension of shares of crystal and ceramics maker Vidriera Leonesa, which is being purchased by Vista Desarrollo and Royal Bank Investments limited.</p>
<p>Shares in the group were suspended on July 18.</p>
<p>&quot;We are raising, as of August 6, the suspension agreed on July 18 and ratified on July 22,&quot; the CNMV said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
